1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:02,026
Get your tax refund today?

2
00:00:02,446 --> 00:00:09,315
Refund advances are everywhere in February. Some are fine. Some cost far more than they look. Let's run the numbers.

3
00:00:10,085 --> 00:00:19,771
Here's the idea. A tax preparer or lender gives you part of your refund now, often a few hundred to a few thousand dollars, and gets paid back when your refund arrives.

4
00:00:20,541 --> 00:00:21,900
First, where the costs hide.

5
00:00:22,320 --> 00:00:33,578
Many advances advertise zero percent. But they often come with conditions: paying for tax prep, a fee to route your refund through their bank, or your money loaded onto their prepaid card.

6
00:00:33,998 --> 00:00:37,154
So the advance can be free, while the package around it isn't.

7
00:00:37,924 --> 00:00:39,694
Here's what a small fee really means.

8
00:00:40,114 --> 00:00:47,387
Say you pay a $40 fee to get $1,000 about three weeks early. As a yearly rate, that's roughly 70%.

9
00:00:47,807 --> 00:00:56,096
And if it also means paying $150 for tax prep you could have done free, the real cost of the advance is $190.

10
00:00:56,866 --> 00:00:58,027
Now, the alternative.

11
00:00:58,447 --> 00:01:07,945
The IRS says most refunds from e-filed returns with direct deposit arrive within 21 days. That's the same few weeks the advance is selling.

12
00:01:08,365 --> 00:01:10,585
So before you take one, check four things.

13
00:01:11,005 --> 00:01:18,306
Can you file for free? If your income qualifies, IRS Free File and free VITA tax help exist for exactly this.

14
00:01:18,726 --> 00:01:21,234
File electronically, with direct deposit.

15
00:01:21,654 --> 00:01:26,042
If you still want an advance, add up every fee, not just the advertised rate.

16
00:01:26,462 --> 00:01:31,671
And decide your refund's job before it lands. Episode thirteen has the four questions.

17
00:01:32,441 --> 00:01:40,072
The Paycheck Planner in the description helps you plan the refund before it arrives. This is general education, not tax advice.

18
00:01:40,492 --> 00:01:43,247
Subscribe for more money math, with real numbers.
